Modifications made in this fork include, among others:
- Conversion from a single dealership into a multi-dealer marketplace
  (dealer profiles, public dealer feed and dealer pages).
- Dealer-scoped inventory, bookings and storage enforced with Supabase
  Row Level Security.
- Superadmin dealer moderation.
- Free-tier hardening (client-side image compression, per-car image caps,
  optional Arcjet, Supabase keep-alive workflow) and Netlify deployment
  configuration.